      <title>Google AI Overviews 自动展开把蓝链结果推到下方</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/Google-AI-Overviews-%E8%87%AA%E5%8A%A8%E5%B1%95%E5%BC%80%E6%8A%8A%E8%93%9D%E9%93%BE%E7%BB%93%E6%9E%9C%E6%8E%A8%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9/</link>
